{"real": false, "dur": 44.22, "sent": [{"start": 0.4, "end": 10.02, "text": "In the 1970s, the applied linguist David Wilkins argued that a syllabus should cover the meanings and functions learners need to express, alongside the grammar.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "1970s,", "s": 1.17}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.55}, {"w": "applied", "s": 1.94}, {"w": "linguist", "s": 2.32}, {"w": "David", "s": 2.71}, {"w": "Wilkins", "s": 3.09}, {"w": "argued", "s": 3.48}, {"w": "that", "s": 3.86}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.25}, {"w": "syllabus", "s": 4.63}, {"w": "should", "s": 5.02}, {"w": "cover", "s": 5.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.78}, {"w": "meanings", "s": 6.17}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.55}, {"w": "functions", "s": 6.94}, {"w": "learners", "s": 7.32}, {"w": "need", "s": 7.71}, {"w": "to", "s": 8.09}, {"w": "express,", "s": 8.48}, {"w": "alongside", "s": 8.86}, {"w": "the", "s": 9.25}, {"w": "grammar.", "s": 9.63}]}, {"start": 10.37, "end": 11.52, "text": "FluOLinGo uses both.", "words": [{"w": "FluOLinGo", "s": 10.37}, {"w": "uses", "s": 10.75}, {"w": "both.", "s": 11.13}]}, {"start": 11.87, "end": 14.56, "text": "Linguistic goals are about the language itself.", "words": [{"w": "Linguistic", "s": 11.87}, {"w": "goals", "s": 12.25}, {"w": "are", "s": 12.64}, {"w": "about", "s": 13.02}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.41}, {"w": "language", "s": 13.79}, {"w": "itself.", "s": 14.18}]}, {"start": 14.91, "end": 22.22, "text": "Communicative goals are about what you do with it, like saying what you like or inviting a friend out.", "words": [{"w": "Communicative", "s": 14.91}, {"w": "goals", "s": 15.3}, {"w": "are", "s": 15.68}, {"w": "about", "s": 16.07}, {"w": "what", "s": 16.45}, {"w": "you", "s": 16.83}, {"w": "do", "s": 17.22}, {"w": "with", "s": 17.6}, {"w": "it,", "s": 17.99}, {"w": "like", "s": 18.37}, {"w": "saying", "s": 18.76}, {"w": "what", "s": 19.14}, {"w": "you", "s": 19.53}, {"w": "like", "s": 19.91}, {"w": "or", "s": 20.3}, {"w": "inviting", "s": 20.68}, {"w": "a", "s": 21.07}, {"w": "friend", "s": 21.45}, {"w": "out.", "s": 21.83}]}, {"start": 22.57, "end": 28.34, "text": "Later frameworks, like the CEFR, went further and distinguished between sounds, vocabulary, grammar and writing.", "words": [{"w": "Later", "s": 22.57}, {"w": "frameworks,", "s": 22.95}, {"w": "like", "s": 23.34}, {"w": "the", "s": 23.72}, {"w": "CEFR,", "s": 24.11}, {"w": "went", "s": 24.49}, {"w": "further", "s": 24.88}, {"w": "and", "s": 25.26}, {"w": "distinguished", "s": 25.65}, {"w": "between", "s": 26.03}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 26.42}, {"w": "vocabulary,", "s": 26.8}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 27.18}, {"w": "and", "s": 27.57}, {"w": "writing.", "s": 27.95}]}, {"start": 28.69, "end": 36.0, "text": "In this talk, I split grammar into two: word forms, like verb endings, and sentence structure, like word order.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 28.69}, {"w": "this", "s": 29.07}, {"w": "talk,", "s": 29.46}, {"w": "I", "s": 29.84}, {"w": "split", "s": 30.23}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 30.61}, {"w": "into", "s": 31.0}, {"w": "two:", "s": 31.38}, {"w": "word", "s": 31.77}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 32.15}, {"w": "like", "s": 32.53}, {"w": "verb", "s": 32.92}, {"w": "endings,", "s": 33.3}, {"w": "and", "s": 33.69}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 34.07}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 34.46}, {"w": "like", "s": 34.84}, {"w": "word", "s": 35.23}, {"w": "order.", "s": 35.61}]}, {"start": 36.35, "end": 43.27, "text": "So I end up with five types of linguistic goal: sounds, vocabulary, word forms, sentence structure and script.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 36.35}, {"w": "I", "s": 36.73}, {"w": "end", "s": 37.12}, {"w": "up", "s": 37.5}, {"w": "with", "s": 37.88}, {"w": "five", "s": 38.27}, {"w": "types", "s": 38.65}, {"w": "of", "s": 39.04}, {"w": "linguistic", "s": 39.42}, {"w": "goal:", "s": 39.81}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 40.19}, {"w": "vocabulary,", "s": 40.58}, {"w": "word", "s": 40.96}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 41.35}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 41.73}, {"w": "structure", "s": 42.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 42.5}, {"w": "script.", "s": 42.88}]}]}